{"parentUuid":"176cb0ee-fa9a-4799-9013-8c05c19637ba","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01YK8cE9oxWd1dWU2TphuzZf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YNsjFQN4HqnXBdXhqPwxEv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add query_router/benches/query_router_bench.rs && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nFix find_node benchmark timeout on CI\n\nThe find_node benchmark shared a router with node_create, which\naccumulated ~900k nodes over its iterations. By the time find_node ran,\neach FIND NODE WHERE id > 0 scanned all accumulated nodes, causing\ncriterion to estimate 1707s for 100 samples and timing out CI.\n\nUse a dedicated router with 100 seeded nodes and sample_size(10) to\nkeep the benchmark fast and deterministic.\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit benchmark fix"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":278,"cache_read_input_tokens":82977,"output_tokens":222,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":278,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CYxECwkBSJcNhA2imrh9B","type":"assistant","uuid":"5fdc81b9-d6cc-4f18-a0a8-5777e3ad718a","timestamp":"2026-03-12T00:20:09.163Z"}
